From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: babarot <b4b4r07@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:26:12 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Hide review requests that no longer need a review

A review request stayed listed after someone else merged, closed or
approved the pull request, and gh-news filters cannot see a pull
request's state. hide_resolved_review_requests lists the states that
hide one ("merged", "closed", "approved"); while it is set, the state is
checked on every refresh (REST for the state, GraphQL for the review
decision, only when "approved" is listed). Empty, the default, fetches
nothing.
